"Listen. I know this probably won't help, but I wanna be clear about one thing."

//【舞殿宮】
<voice name='舞殿宮' class='舞殿宮' src='voice/mc01/0020050a10'>
//「罪の意識を持つ必要は無いよ。景明くんは
//な。
//　どんな惨いことになっても、命令したのは
//わしや。責任もわし」
"None of this is your responsibility. I'm giving the orders. That means no matter what happens, I'm the one who has to answer for it."

//【舞殿宮】
<voice name='舞殿宮' class='舞殿宮' src='voice/mc01/0020060a10'>
